## Hosted Allmaps services

These terms apply to APIs hosted and operated by Allmaps, including
[api.allmaps.org](https://api.allmaps.org),
[annotations.allmaps.org](https://annotations.allmaps.org) and
[Allmaps Tile Server](https://allmaps.xyz).

These terms govern access to the services operated by Allmaps. They do not
change the licenses covering the API source code or georeference data, and they
do not apply when you run the open source software on your own infrastructure.

### Fair use of hosted APIs

Commercial companies and institutions outside the
[IIIF–Allmaps Partnership](/iiif-partnership) can currently use the hosted
Allmaps APIs, including Allmaps Tile Server, without a paid agreement under
this fair use policy.

Please use the APIs responsibly and avoid excessive requests that affect
availability for others. If you expect substantial traffic or plan a large
automated workload, [contact us](/contact) to discuss your needs.

This policy may change as Allmaps develops. Commercial use may become subject
to different terms or a paid agreement in the future.

## Software

The public Allmaps packages include a license file in their source directory.
For example, the [MapLibre plugin is published under the MIT license](https://github.com/allmaps/allmaps/blob/main/packages/maplibre/LICENSE.md).
Check the license included with the specific package and version you use.

The source code for the Allmaps APIs is published under the
[GNU AGPL-3.0 license](https://github.com/allmaps/allmaps/blob/main/apis/rest/LICENSE.md),
which permits commercial use, including running your own API instance, subject
to the conditions of that license.

[Browse the Allmaps source code](https://github.com/allmaps/allmaps)

## Georeference data

Allmaps publishes its public georeference dataset under
[CC0](https://creativecommons.org/public-domain/cc0/). This includes ground
control points, clipping masks and references to IIIF resources.

[Explore and download the open data](/data)

## Map images

Map images are served by the institutions and repositories that publish them.
The license for Allmaps georeference data does not describe the rights to those
images. Consult the source collection's rights and attribution information
when reusing an image.

## Questions about usage

[Contact Allmaps](/contact) with questions about using the software, data or
hosted services in your project.
